        <p><seg source="#source-15522-15548">目にうつる日なり</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-15548-15570">家にこもらむ</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-15570-15582">この次の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-15582-15603"><rb>休日</rb><rt>やすみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-15603-15629">に一日寝てみむと</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-15629-15649">思ひすごしぬ</seg></p>
