        <p><seg source="#source-19320-19349">何事も思ふことなく</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-19349-19366">いそがしく</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-19366-19378">暮らせし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19378-19399"><rb>一日</rb><rt>ひとひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19399-19424">を忘れじと思ふ</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-19424-19433">何事も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19433-19457"><rb>金金</rb><rt>かねかね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19457-19471">とわらひ</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-19471-19480">すこし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19480-19492"><rb>経</rb><rt>へ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19492-19497">て</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-19497-19506">またも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19506-19521"><rb>俄</rb><rt>には</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19521-19542">かに不平つのり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19542-19554"><rb>来</rb><rt>く</rt></ruby></p>
        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19558-19570"><rb>誰</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19570-19573">そ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19573-19588"><rb>我</rb><rt>われ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19588-19593">に</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-19593-19614">ピストルにても</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19614-19626"><rb>撃</rb><rt>う</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19626-19640">てよかし</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-19640-19683">伊藤のごとく死にて見せなむ</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-19683-19700">やとばかり</seg></p>
        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19700-19718"><rb>桂</rb><rt>かつら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19718-19751">首相に手とられし夢みて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-19751-19763"><rb>覚</rb><rt>さ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-19763-19771">めぬ</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-19771-19793">秋の夜の二時</seg></p>
      </div>
