        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38226-38241"><rb>拾</rb><rt>ひろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38241-38268">ふがごとくさまよひ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38268-38280"><rb>行</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38280-38290">きぬ</seg></p>
