      <div>
        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38555-38570"><rb>潮</rb><rt>しほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38570-38585">かをる北の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38585-38606"><rb>浜辺</rb><rt>はまべ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38606-38611">の</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-38611-38626">砂山のかの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38626-38653"><rb>浜薔薇</rb><rt>はまなす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38653-38658">よ</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-38658-38683">今年も咲けるや</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-38683-38713">たのみつる年の若さを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-38713-38728"><rb>数</rb><rt>かぞ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-38728-38739">へみて</seg></p>
