        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46377-46398"><rb>曠野</rb><rt>あらの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46398-46416">の汽車の窓を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46416-46431"><rb>照</rb><rt>てら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46431-46441">せり</seg></p>
