        <p><seg source="#source-46727-46745">名のみ知りて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46745-46760"><rb>縁</rb><rt>えん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46760-46792">もゆかりもなき土地の</seg></p>
